ernization, leak detection systems, preventative maintenance tracking, and enhanced vendor management procedures.\n\n# LOSS HISTORY SUMMARY\n\n- 03/14/2022: Roof Leak / Water Damage. $74,200 incurred.\n- 11/22/2023: Slip and Fall Liability. $22,800 incurred.\n- 05/09/2025: Wind Damage. $48,600 incurred.\n\n# WHY THIS ACCOUNT REMAINS ATTRACTIVE\n\n1. Established ownership and management team\n2. Stable occupancy and diversified tenant base\n3. Ongoing capital improvement investments\n4. Improved water mitigation procedures\n5. No open claims or unresolved litigation\n6. Strong cooperation with carrier recommendations\n\n# COVERAGES REQUESTED\n\n- Commercial Property\n- General Liability\n- Business Income\n- Equipment Breakdown\n- Umbrella — $5M\n\nHarper Lewis\nLone Star Property Risk Advisors\n\n'} index=2 keys=['company', 'locations', 'coverages', 'prior_insurance', 'loss_history', 'legal', 'broker_notes', 'requested_effective_date', 'summary', '_source_doc', '_doc_type', '_confidence', '_markdown_text'] loss_history_in_ext=3 prior_insurance_in_ext=0 source=realistic_broker_submission_oakridge.pdf
